    "section_rich_text_7Lb9dX": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yJ7qgd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>1. Meet the Faces Behind Simran Design</h2><p>I’m <strong>Simran</strong>, the founder and creative director of Simran Design Ltd, an interior design studio based in Leicester. We specialise in <strong>commercial interiors</strong><em><strong> for </strong></em><strong>ambitious business owners</strong>. I started the studio in 2021 after graduating with a degree in Textile Design from Loughborough University and diving headfirst into my passion for transforming everyday spaces into impactful, functional experiences.</p><p>We’ve since grown into a small but mighty team. <strong>Shreya</strong>, our design assistant and creative partner, works closely with me, who helps bring our visions to life through floor plans, visuals, and on-site collaboration.</p><p>We design:</p><ul><li>Full-service interior projects across the Midlands</li><li>Remote E-Design for international clients (especially in Dubai)</li><li>Spaces that reflect our clients' values, ambition, and brand identity<br/></li></ul>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_yJ7qgd"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wrapper",
        "align_text": "text-left",
        "bg_color": "",
        "color": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "section_rich_text_6fbNzN": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_xT3htA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>3. A Snapshot of Our Recent Projects</h2><p>Here’s a glimpse into some of the work we’ve been proud to lead recently:</p><p><br/> (Remote): Bold yet minimal design, custom joinery, glass-walled boardroom, and a 16-person workspace for a high-growth international team.<br/></p><p><br/> (UK): A caramel-toned, organic-inspired dessert and coffee bar — designed as a warm, inviting destination for all ages.<br/></p><p><br/> (Leicester): A two-storey residential conversion into a collaborative office hub, complete with hot desks, meeting nooks, and a homely yet professional atmosphere.<br/></p><p><br/>: A luxury multi-use space combining hair, beauty, and a dog-friendly café. Curves, softness, and mood lighting take centre stage.<br/></p><p>Each of these projects has challenged us in the best way — helping us grow, innovate, and stretch creatively.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_xT3htA"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wrapper",
        "align_text": "text-left",
