    "section_rich_text_mRwGbr": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_PFKR8W": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>4. Out & About: Recent Design Events</h2><p>We’re big believers in staying inspired and connected within the industry. Over the last few weeks, we’ve been busy attending some standout events, most notably:</p><ul><li><strong>Clerkenwell Design Week. </strong>A day filled with showroom visits, product launches, and trend forecasting that’s helping us shape moodboards for upcoming client briefs.</li><li><strong>\"Designing and Expanding in the Middle East\"</strong> - Business and Interiors' Latest Design Leaders Talk.<br/></li></ul>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_PFKR8W"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
