    "section_rich_text_wDJrER": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_y6VpDj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>5. What You Can Expect from This Blog</h2><p>Every two weeks, we’ll be sharing a new post covering:<br/>✅ Real project journeys<br/>✅ Tips for business owners planning a commercial space<br/>✅ Behind-the-scenes stories from our studio<br/>✅ Sourcing secrets and material trends<br/>✅ Interviews, event recaps, and Q&As</p><p>Our goal? To demystify the design process and show what <em>strategic beauty</em> really looks like in the world of commercial interiors.</p><p> </p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
